+ * address range.  The source uses both the first 0xC bytes as
+ * _Toy_804A26B8_t and the range from +0x194 as Toy_804A284C, while the final
+ * +0x3F0 bytes are Toy_804A2AA8. Keep those views in one object on portable
+ * builds so a profile snapshot cannot omit the linker-adjacent bytes.
